msgid "Real Evaluation"
msgstr "실제 Robot 평가"

msgid "SO-101 performing the vial-to-rack task on physical hardware."
msgstr "실제 SO-101이 vial-to-rack task를 수행합니다."

msgid "What Do I Need for This Module?"
msgstr "이 Module에 필요한 준비물"

msgid ""
"Hands-on. You'll need the calibrated follower, both cameras, assembled workspace, running "
"`so101-workshop` container, and the checkpoint evaluated in simulation."
msgstr ""
"실습입니다. Calibration된 follower, camera 두 대, 조립한 workspace, 실행 중인 `so101-workshop` container, "
"simulation에서 평가한 checkpoint가 필요합니다."

msgid "Learning Objectives"
msgstr "학습 목표"

msgid ""
"Explore the sim-to-real gap by comparing policies trained on sim-only and real-only data on the "
"physical robot."
msgstr "실제 robot에서 sim-only와 real-only data로 학습한 policy를 비교해 Sim-to-Real gap을 살펴봅니다."

msgid ""
"Compare policies trained on different types of simulation data, including state-machine and "
"human-teleoperated demonstrations."
msgstr "State-machine 및 human teleoperation 등 서로 다른 simulation data로 학습한 policy를 비교합니다."

msgid ""
"Recognize how overfitting to state-machine data can limit a policy's robustness and lead it to "
"repeat the demonstrations' motion patterns and stopping behavior."
msgstr ""
"State-machine data의 overfitting이 robustness를 제한하고 demonstration의 motion pattern과 정지 행동을 반복하게 하는 "
"방식을 이해합니다."

msgid "Workspace Prep"
msgstr "Workspace 준비"

msgid "Review the [Safety](08-operating-so101.md#safety) protocol before running the robot."
msgstr "실행 전에 [Safety](08-operating-so101.md#safety) 절차를 확인하세요."

msgid "**Place** one to three vials on the mat and position the rack in its reference location."
msgstr "Mat에 vial 1–3개를 **놓고** rack을 기준 위치에 배치합니다."

msgid ""
"**Match** camera views and [lightbox setup](05-building-workspace.md#set-up-the-light) used for "
"collection."
msgstr "수집 시 camera view와 [lightbox 설정](05-building-workspace.md#set-up-the-light)을 **맞춥니다**."

msgid "Run the First Policy: Trained on Sim-Only Data"
msgstr "첫 번째 Policy: Sim-Only Data로 학습"

msgid ""
"**Continue** in the same container terminal after [stopping simulation evaluation and its "
"background server](11-sim-evaluation.md#stop-evaluation)."
msgstr ""
"[Simulation 평가와 background server를 종료](11-sim-evaluation.md#stop-evaluation)한 뒤 같은 container "
"terminal에서 **계속**합니다."

msgid "Reconnect to the Container Shell"
msgstr "Container Shell 재접속"

msgid ""
"If you need to reconnect to the running workshop container, open a terminal on the **host** and "
"run:"
msgstr "실행 중인 workshop container에 다시 접속하려면 **host** terminal에서 다음을 실행합니다."

msgid ""
"To check whether the container is running, use `docker ps` and look for `so101-workshop` in the "
"`NAMES` column. If you are already at the container prompt, skip this step."
msgstr "`docker ps`의 `NAMES`에서 `so101-workshop`을 찾아 실행 여부를 확인합니다. 이미 container prompt에 있다면 건너뜁니다."

msgid ""
"Inside the container, **select** the model used in sim. Reuse the camera indices you already "
"identified:"
msgstr "Container에서 simulation에 사용한 model을 **선택**합니다. 확인한 camera index를 재사용하세요."

msgid "What to Expect"
msgstr "예상되는 동작"

msgid ""
"This model was trained on 500 state-machine demonstrations in simulation, with no teleoperation "
"or real demonstrations."
msgstr "Simulation의 state-machine demonstration 500개로 학습했으며 teleoperation이나 실제 demonstration은 포함하지 않았습니다."

msgid ""
"At the end of an episode, it will simply hover at the vial drop-off location, since it did not "
"see a \"return to home\" demonstration. It suffers from overfitting, being biased toward some "
"vial positions and lacking motion diversity."
msgstr ""
"“Return to home” demonstration이 없어 episode 끝에서 vial을 놓은 위치에 머뭅니다. 특정 vial 위치에 편향되고 motion 다양성이 "
"부족한 overfitting이 있습니다."

msgid ""
"This policy overfit to the particular grasps and vial positions in its state-machine "
"demonstrations, so expect a low success rate on the real robot."
msgstr "State-machine demonstration의 특정 grasp와 vial 위치에 overfit되었으므로 실제 robot에서는 낮은 성공률을 예상합니다."

msgid "Optional: Try This Policy in Simulation First"
msgstr "선택 사항: 먼저 Simulation에서 시험"

msgid ""
"**Stop** the real rollout and continue in the same container terminal. Keep the selected "
"`MODEL_ID` and task instruction."
msgstr "실제 rollout을 **종료**한 뒤 같은 container terminal을 사용합니다. `MODEL_ID`와 task instruction은 유지합니다."

msgid "**Start** the simulation policy server below, or reuse it if it is already running."
msgstr "아래 simulation policy server를 **시작**하거나 이미 실행 중이면 재사용합니다."

msgid "**Wait** for `Policy server ready`, then **run** the evaluation:"
msgstr "`Policy server ready`를 **기다린 뒤** 평가를 **실행**합니다."

msgid ""
"**Open** [http://localhost:8090](http://localhost:8090). Use only one browser tab connected to "
"the viewer at a time."
msgstr "[http://localhost:8090](http://localhost:8090)을 **엽니다**. Viewer에는 browser tab 하나만 연결하세요."

msgid ""
"**Stop** the background server before running the real policy. If evaluation is still running, "
"press **Ctrl+C** first:"
msgstr "실제 policy를 실행하기 전에 background server를 **종료**합니다. 평가가 실행 중이면 먼저 **Ctrl+C**를 누르세요."

msgid "Or **stop all policy servers** in the container:"
msgstr "또는 container의 **모든 policy server를 종료**합니다."

msgid ""
"If reusing a server from another terminal, stop it there instead. Continue with the real rollout "
"below; it loads the policy directly."
msgstr "다른 terminal의 server를 재사용했다면 해당 terminal에서 종료합니다. 아래 실제 rollout은 policy를 직접 로드합니다."

msgid "**Run** an interactive rollout on the real robot:"
msgstr "실제 robot에서 interactive rollout을 **실행**합니다."

msgid "Rollout controls"
msgstr "Rollout Control"

msgid ""
"The arm moves to the workshop start pose on startup, then waits for **P**. Keep the rollout "
"terminal focused. Keys are case-insensitive."
msgstr ""
"시작 시 arm이 workshop 시작 pose로 움직인 뒤 **P**를 기다립니다. Rollout terminal에 focus를 두세요. Key는 대소문자를 구분하지 "
"않습니다."

msgid ""
"Wait for `Paused` before rearranging props. On exit, wait for cleanup and any return motion to "
"finish before touching the arm."
msgstr "소품을 옮기기 전에 `Paused`를 기다리세요. 종료할 때도 cleanup과 복귀 동작이 끝난 뒤 arm을 만집니다."

msgid ""
"When comparing models, record the first-action delay shown in the terminal and the number of "
"successes out of scored trials."
msgstr "Model 비교 시 terminal에 표시되는 첫 action 지연과 평가한 trial 중 성공 수를 기록하세요."

msgid ""
"Check camera framing during your first rollouts Before pressing **P**, check the external-camera "
"preview: it should show **most of the rack and some of the robot**, with the vial pickup area "
"visible. If you've already set the correct camera angle, move the props into frame while the "
"robot is paused. The camera has a fairly narrow field of view, so prop positions are important. "
"If the policy struggles, check this framing before trying another model."
msgstr ""
"첫 rollout에서 camera 구도를 확인하세요. **P**를 누르기 전에 external preview에 **rack 대부분과 robot 일부**, vial pickup"
" area가 보이는지 확인합니다. Camera 각도를 이미 맞췄다면 robot이 paused일 때 소품을 화면 안으로 옮기세요. FoV가 좁아 소품 위치가 중요합니다. "
"Policy가 잘 동작하지 않으면 model을 바꾸기 전에 구도부터 확인하세요."

msgid "Understand the command flags"
msgstr "명령 Flag 이해"

msgid ""
"This command uses `--policy.n_action_steps=16` for the action return limit and the separate real-"
"time chunking (RTC) setting `--inference.rtc.execution_horizon=16`. Use the instruction "
"associated with each model's training data. The asynchronous inference engine is selected with "
"RTC compensation disabled."
msgstr ""
"Policy 반환 길이는 `--policy.n_action_steps=16`, 별도의 RTC 설정은 `--inference.rtc.execution_horizon=16`을 "
"사용합니다. 각 model의 training data에 맞는 instruction을 사용하세요. Async inference engine을 선택하되 RTC "
"compensation은 끕니다."

msgid ""
"`--robot.use_degrees=true` keeps the arm joints in degrees, matching the workshop's recorded "
"states and actions. The gripper uses its percentage convention."
msgstr ""
"`--robot.use_degrees=true`는 arm joint를 degree로 유지해 기록된 state/action과 맞춥니다. Gripper는 percent 규약을 "
"사용합니다."

msgid ""
"The arm automatically moves toward the mean episode-start pose from `sreetz-"
"nv/so101_newton_dr500_20260923`, then waits for **P**. Keep clear during startup. The terminal "
"prints the dataset-derived mean and standard deviation. **Before pressing P**, verify the "
"achieved pose; computing the mean alone does not establish a matched start."
msgstr ""
"Arm은 `sreetz-nv/so101_newton_dr500_20260923`의 평균 episode-start pose로 자동 이동한 뒤 **P**를 기다립니다. 시작 중 "
"경로를 비우세요. Terminal에 dataset-derived 평균과 표준편차가 표시됩니다. **P를 누르기 전에** 실제 pose를 확인하세요. 평균 계산만으로 시작 조건"
" 일치가 입증되지는 않습니다."

msgid ""
"The starting pose matters because it sets the cameras' initial views, the motions the arm can "
"reach, and the trajectory produced by GR00T's relative actions. A pose outside the training "
"dataset's starting distribution can make a capable policy fail for reasons unrelated to its "
"weights. Verify the achieved pose and current gripper calibration before comparing policies. If "
"the pose requires an offset or does not match the dataset distribution, label the trial as an "
"out-of-distribution test rather than a matched evaluation."
msgstr ""
"Starting pose는 초기 camera view, 도달 가능한 motion, GR00T relative action의 trajectory를 결정합니다. Training-"
"start distribution 밖이면 weight와 무관하게 유능한 policy도 실패할 수 있습니다. 비교 전에 실제 pose와 현재 gripper "
"calibration을 확인하세요. Offset이 필요하거나 distribution과 다르다면 matched evaluation이 아닌 out-of-distribution "
"test로 표시합니다."

msgid ""
"The log shows `Waiting | first policy action`, followed by `Running | first policy action after "
"... s` when the first action is sent. The default `workshop` strategy runs until **Q**, **Esc**, "
"or **Ctrl+C**; `--duration` is ignored."
msgstr ""
"첫 action을 보낼 때 `Waiting | first policy action` 다음에 `Running | first policy action after ... s`가 "
"표시됩니다. 기본 `workshop` strategy는 **Q**, **Esc**, **Ctrl+C**까지 실행하며 `--duration`은 무시합니다."

msgid "Run the Second Policy"
msgstr "두 번째 Policy 실행"

msgid "**Exit** the first rollout with **Q**, **Esc**, or **Ctrl+C** and wait for cleanup to finish."
msgstr "**Q**, **Esc**, **Ctrl+C**로 첫 rollout을 **종료**하고 cleanup을 기다립니다."

msgid ""
"**Select** the policy trained only on simulated teleoperation. Keep your verified wrist and "
"external camera configuration:"
msgstr "Simulation teleoperation만으로 학습한 policy를 **선택**합니다. 검증한 wrist 및 external camera 설정은 유지하세요."

msgid ""
"This model was trained on 75 human teleoperated demonstrations using simulation. These motions "
"contain enough diversity to train a more robust model, even though there is significantly less "
"demonstration data compared to the first policy. Quality of data is key."
msgstr ""
"Simulation의 human teleoperation demonstration 75개로 학습한 model입니다. 첫 policy보다 data 양은 훨씬 적지만 motion"
" 다양성이 있어 더 견고한 model을 만들 수 있습니다. Data 품질이 중요합니다."

msgid ""
"After vial drop-off, the demonstrations return the robot near its start pose. This creates a "
"looping behavior. Notice how the robot will continue to pick vials in a loop. This won't be seen "
"in simulation due to an earlier termination condition when the vial is placed. Compare that "
"behavior with the first policy."
msgstr ""
"이 demonstration은 vial을 놓은 뒤 robot을 시작 pose 근처로 돌려보내 반복 동작을 만듭니다. Robot이 vial을 계속 집는지 관찰하세요. "
"Simulation에서는 placement 시 일찍 종료하므로 이 동작이 보이지 않습니다. 첫 policy와 비교하세요."

msgid ""
"**Run** the second policy on the real robot. Startup moves the arm toward this dataset's mean "
"starting pose; keep clear and verify the achieved pose before pressing **P**."
msgstr ""
"두 번째 policy를 실제 robot에서 **실행**합니다. 시작 시 이 dataset의 평균 starting pose로 움직이므로 경로를 비우고 **P** 전에 실제 "
"pose를 확인하세요."

msgid ""
"**Watch what happens after placement.** Compare the first policy's lack of a return movement with"
" the second policy's return toward a ready pose and continuation to another vial. Keep clear "
"while it continues, and score or stop the trial using the controls above."
msgstr ""
"**Placement 이후를 관찰하세요.** 복귀하지 않는 첫 policy와 ready pose로 돌아가 다음 vial을 시도하는 두 번째 policy를 비교합니다. 계속 "
"움직이는 동안 경로를 비우고 위 control로 채점하거나 종료하세요."

msgid "Optional: Try i1: State-Machine-Only Training"
msgstr "선택 사항: State-Machine-Only i1 시험"

msgid "**Stop** the previous rollout and wait for cleanup, then **select** this model:"
msgstr "이전 rollout을 **종료**하고 cleanup 후 다음 model을 **선택**합니다."

msgid ""
"This model was trained on 125 state-machine demonstrations in simulation, with the human-"
"emulation state machine built from teleoperation demonstrations. In our real-robot trials, it "
"succeeded in **8 of 20 trials (40%)**. Watch for missed grasps or rack-slot alignment errors, and"
" notice what it does after placement."
msgstr ""
"Teleoperation demonstration을 모방하도록 만든 state machine의 simulation demonstration 125개로 학습했습니다. 실제 "
"시험에서는 **20회 중 8회(40%)** 성공했습니다. Grasp 누락, rack-slot 정렬 오류, placement 후 동작을 관찰하세요."

msgid ""
"The command uses the initial poses from this model's state-machine training dataset. Verify the "
"achieved starting pose before pressing **P**."
msgstr "이 명령은 해당 model의 state-machine training dataset 초기 pose를 사용합니다. **P** 전에 실제 시작 pose를 확인하세요."

msgid "**Run** the policy on the real robot:"
msgstr "실제 robot에서 policy를 **실행**합니다."

msgid "Optional: Compare Johnny42, Trained on Real Data"
msgstr "선택 사항: 실제 Data로 학습한 Johnny42 비교"

msgid ""
"[Johnny42](datasets-and-models.md#johnny42-real-to-real-reference) was trained on **50 real-robot"
" demonstrations, not simulation data**. Stop the previous rollout and wait for cleanup, then set "
"the model, instruction, and camera configuration below. Reuse your verified camera indices:"
msgstr ""
"[Johnny42](datasets-and-models.md#johnny42-real-to-real-reference)는 **simulation이 아닌 실제 robot "
"demonstration 50개**로 학습했습니다. 이전 rollout을 종료하고 cleanup 후 아래 model, instruction, camera 설정을 지정하세요. "
"검증한 camera index를 재사용합니다."

msgid ""
"This model was trained on 50 real demonstrations. Use it to compare a real-data policy with the "
"simulation-trained policies on your station."
msgstr "실제 demonstration 50개로 학습한 model입니다. 본인의 station에서 simulation 기반 policy와 비교하세요."

msgid ""
"This model's training data was collected before we standardized camera names, so it uses `front` "
"for the external camera. Switch back to `external` afterward by running the `ROBOT_CAMERAS` "
"export included with the other model rollouts."
msgstr ""
"Camera 이름 표준화 이전에 수집한 data여서 external camera 이름이 `front`입니다. 이후 다른 model rollout의 `ROBOT_CAMERAS`"
" export를 실행해 `external`로 되돌리세요."

msgid "**Run the real evaluation** with the same model:"
msgstr "같은 model로 **실제 평가를 실행**합니다."

msgid "Key Takeaways"
msgstr "핵심 내용"

msgid ""
"Overfitting to particular grasps and vial positions can yield high simulation evaluation success "
"rates that do not translate to reliable real-world performance."
msgstr "특정 grasp와 vial 위치에 overfit되면 simulation 성공률은 높아도 실제 성능은 안정적이지 않을 수 있습니다."

msgid ""
"The first policy's state-machine demonstrations did not include a return after release, so it "
"does not learn a complete repeating loop."
msgstr "첫 policy의 state-machine demonstration에는 release 후 복귀가 없어 완전한 반복 loop를 배우지 못했습니다."

msgid ""
"The second policy's teleoperated demonstrations include continuation after placement. Watch how "
"this supports returning to a ready pose and attempting another pickup."
msgstr ""
"두 번째 policy의 teleoperation demonstration은 placement 후 동작까지 포함합니다. Ready pose 복귀와 다음 pickup으로 "
"이어지는지 관찰하세요."

msgid ""
"A learned return is different from the rollout controller's homing after **S/F** or **N**. "
"Compare what the policy does before you end the trial."
msgstr "학습된 복귀와 **S/F** 또는 **N** 뒤 rollout controller의 homing은 다릅니다. Trial을 끝내기 전에 policy 자체의 동작을 비교하세요."

msgid "Match the starting pose to each policy's own training data, and record the behavior you observe."
msgstr "각 policy의 training data에 시작 pose를 맞추고 관찰한 행동을 기록합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Key"
msgstr "Key"

msgid "Action"
msgstr "동작"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**P**"
msgstr "**P**"

msgid "**P for policy:** Start the first or next trial."
msgstr "**P for policy:** 첫 trial 또는 다음 trial을 시작합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**S / F**"
msgstr "**S / F**"

msgid "Score success/failure, return to the start pose, and pause."
msgstr "성공/실패를 기록하고 시작 pose로 복귀한 뒤 일시 정지합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**N / →**"
msgstr "**N / →**"

msgid "**N for next:** Discard the trial, return to the start pose, and pause."
msgstr "**N for next:** Trial을 폐기하고 시작 pose로 복귀한 뒤 일시 정지합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**Q / Esc**"
msgstr "**Q / Esc**"

msgid "**Q for Quit:** Exit and discard any unfinished trial."
msgstr "**Q for Quit:** 종료하며 미완료 trial은 폐기합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**Ctrl+C**"
msgstr "**Ctrl+C**"

msgid "Stop the rollout and run cleanup."
msgstr "Rollout을 중단하고 cleanup을 실행합니다."
